</div>
</div>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td colspan="2">&nbsp;</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td colspan="2" style="color:#655665; font-family: helvetica,arial; font-size:80%"><b>
No explicit information on uncertainties of observed wavelengths is available in ASD for this selection of lines.<br />
<u><i>&lambda;</i> in</u>: <span style="color:darkred">vacuum</span> <span style="color:navy"></span><br />
<u>Highest relative intensity</u>: 35000<br />
<span class="hnd">Some data for neutral and singly-charged ions are available in the <a href="/PhysRefData/Handbook/index.html" target="_new">Handbook of Basic Atomic Spectroscopic Data</a></span>
</b></td>
  </tr>
</table>

